1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Atelier (atelier.materialstone.dev), the game hub of Material Stone Games

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,500
The player signs in with Google

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:16,000
Basic Google Sign-In asks only for name, email and profile picture.
No YouTube access is requested here.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,500
After sign-in, Atelier offers a YouTube subscription check
for this week's subscriber prototype

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,500
The player clicks "Verify subscription" and picks the same Google account

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Google shows the unverified-app notice (expected before verification).
The player continues via Advanced.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:41,500
Consent screen: Atelier requests a single scope,
"View your YouTube account" (youtube.readonly)

8
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:57,000
The address bar shows this app's OAuth client ID (client_id=...)

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
The player allows access

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Our server calls subscriptions.list once (mine=true, forChannelId = our channel)
and confirms the subscription

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Atelier stores only yes/no and an expiry (end of this week). The access token is never stored.
Players can clear the check at any time in Settings.

12
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:28,000
This week's subscriber prototype is now playable

13
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:40,300
Privacy policy: YouTube data use follows the Google API Services
User Data Policy, including the Limited Use requirements

